sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as 👤 Caller (Speaking into iQOO Z9 Mic)
    participant PhoneChrome as 📱 Chrome Browser on iQOO Z9<br/>(http://localhost:8000)
    participant ReverseTunnel as 🔌 ADB Reverse / Local LAN<br/>(tcp:8000 loopback tunnel)
    participant ServerBridge as 🖥️ FastAPI WebSocket Bridge<br/>(server.py on Host PC)
    participant SapiASR as 🎙️ Windows SAPI ASR Engine<br/>(Microsoft Speech Recognizer 8.0 en-US)
    participant PreGuard as 🛡️ Pre-LLM Guardrail<br/>(Telugu & Script Filter)
    participant OllamaLLM as 🧠 Ollama qwen2.5:3b LLM<br/>(Local CPU Inference)
    participant PostGuard as 🛡️ Post-LLM Guardrail<br/>(ASCII / English Validator)
    participant SapiTTS as 🔊 Windows SAPI5 TTS Engine<br/>(Microsoft David Desktop 22kHz)
    actor CallerEars as 👂 Caller (Listening to Handset Speaker)

    Note over Caller,CallerEars: VALIDATED AUDIO PATH — 100% ENGLISH ONLY — ZERO EXTERNAL APIS

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% UPLINK AUDIO
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    Caller->>PhoneChrome: 1. Speaks English into handset mic (Hold button)
    Note over PhoneChrome: AudioContext records 16kHz PCM<br/>Encodes clean 16-bit Mono WAV in JS
    PhoneChrome->>ReverseTunnel: 2. Transmits audio_payload over WebSocket (Base64 WAV)
    ReverseTunnel->>ServerBridge: 3. Delivers payload to server (<5ms delay)
    ServerBridge->>SapiASR: 4. Feeds WAV to SpInprocRecognizer (en-US)
    Note over SapiASR: Transcribes in ~250ms<br/>Rejects non-speech tones as empty
    SapiASR->>ServerBridge: 5. Emits English transcript
    ServerBridge->>PhoneChrome: 6. Push real-time transcript to display

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% INPUT VALIDATION & LLM REASONING
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    ServerBridge->>PreGuard: 7. Evaluates input against Telugu Unicode block & keywords
    alt Non-English / Telugu detected
        PreGuard-->>SapiTTS: Short-circuit: "I can only communicate in English..."
    else English verified
        PreGuard->>OllamaLLM: 8. Passes prompt + conversation history to Ollama
        Note over OllamaLLM: qwen2.5:3b generates 1-2 sentence response<br/>(Warm latency: ~1.5s on CPU)
        OllamaLLM->>PostGuard: 9. Returns candidate text
        Note over PostGuard: Validates English characters & strips markdown
        PostGuard->>SapiTTS: 10. Forwards sanitized English response
    end

    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    %% DOWNLINK AUDIO & PLAYBACK
    %% -------------------------------------------------------------
    Note over SapiTTS: Synthesizes speech via Microsoft David<br/>(Warm latency: ~130ms; RTF ~0.03x)
    SapiTTS->>ServerBridge: 11. Returns 22kHz 16-bit WAV audio buffer
    ServerBridge->>ReverseTunnel: 12. Sends assistant_response JSON with Base64 audio + latency metrics
    ReverseTunnel->>PhoneChrome: 13. Receives downlink audio packet
    PhoneChrome->>CallerEars: 14. Plays speech instantly through phone speaker
    Note over Caller,CallerEars: Total Roundtrip Latency: ~1.5s - 2.0s (Natural Spoken Dialogue)
